{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "specs/0053 §5: the cases, as data. Each case names its family (K1-K8), the host binding the adapter is built with, the tool and the model's arguments. Expected values are never here: the oracle computes them in the same run. A K5/K7 case's clock_group selects its measured id/clock lists (§3a).",
